                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "modelConfiguration": {
                      "modelProperties": {},
                      "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                      "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                      "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
                    },
                    "name": "dynamicSkillItemSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791605880"
                  },
                  "code": "DYNAMICSKILLITEMSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1765791549904",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765791549906_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## References\n\n- Employee Business Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}};\n- Employee Position Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}};\n- Employee Department Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}};\n- Employee Business Unit Name:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}};\n- Skill Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_name}}\n- Skill Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_description}}\n- Skill Business Driver:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_business_driver}}\n- Skill Business Capability:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_business_capability}}\n- Skill Domain:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_domain}}\n- Rating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.proficiency_rating_scale}} - ratings from high to low\n- Target Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.target_proficiency_rating}}\n- Matrix Manager Selected Rating:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_proficiency_rating}};\n- Matrix Manager Rating Description:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_proficiency_rating_description}};\n- Matrix Manager Initial Comments:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_comments}};\n- Interim Feedback Summary:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\n- Colleague Feedback Summary:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\n\n## Task Instructions\nYou are writing a performance evaluation for an employees skill as a matrix manager. Write a single, cohesive paragraph (maximum 300 words) that:\n- **Uses second person** - Write directly to the employee using \"you\" (or their name if provided)\n- **Synthesizes** all provided information without copying verbatim. The matrix manager initial comments are your comments and what will be replaced by the evaluation comments you generate and are not provided by a different matrix manager.\n- **Addresses** the employee's progress toward the target rating\n- **Contextualizes** performance within their role, department, and business unit\n- **Identifies** key performance trends during the review period\n- **Balances** recognition of strengths with constructive areas for growth\n- **Maintains** a professional, objective tone appropriate for formal documentation\n\n## Quality Standards\n- Use professional, performance management language\n- Ensure all content is workplace-appropriate and non-discriminatory\n- Base recommendations on provided data, not assumptions"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "modelConfiguration": {
                      "modelProperties": {},
                      "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                      "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                      "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
                    },
                    "name": "dynamicSkillSectionSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791605880"
                  },
                  "code": "DYNAMICSKILLSECTIONSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1765791574013",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765791574015_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are assisting a matrix manager in writing a personalised evaluation summary for the skills section of a performance document. The summary should reflect the employee’s performance and/or proficiency ratings across skills, based on multiple qualitative and quantitative input sources.\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Synthesise all **available** inputs into one coherent, personalised summary comment.\n2. Abstract and summarise content without copying or closely paraphrasing the original input.\n3. Write in the second person, addressing the employee as “you” (or by name, if included in the input).\n4. Use a professional, balanced, and constructive tone that accurately reflects the content provided—including both strengths and areas for improvement.\n5. Include **constructive or negative feedback** where relevant, with an emphasis on professionalism, actionable insights, and developmental framing.\n6. Ensure the final output is no longer than 500 words.\n7. Do **not** generate any content based on missing or empty input fields—simply ignore them.\n8. Use the provided employee information to tailor the summary to the employee’s role, department, business unit, and performance document context.\n9. If only interim performance feedback is available, you may reference it to note continuity or progress, but avoid drawing final conclusions from it alone.\n10. **Strictly exclude** any content that is potentially offensive, discriminatory, or inappropriate. Do not reference or rephrase such input. Constructive feedback—including performance gaps, challenges, or skill development needs—is encouraged and should be reflected accurately when applicable.\n\nContextual Inputs:\n* (Optional) Initial Matrix Manager Evaluation Summary (prior to summarisation): {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_section_comments}}\n* (Optional) Matrix Manager Selected Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_section_rating}}\n* (Optional) Matrix Manager Selected Performance Rating Description: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_section_rating_description}}\n* (Optional) Matrix Manager Comments and Ratings for Individual Skills: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.matrix_manager_item_rating_and_comments}}\n* (Optional) Interim Performance Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Participant Feedback Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\n* (Optional) Performance Rating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.section_rating_scale}}\n\nEmployee Info:\n* Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}}\n* Position: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}}\n* Legal Entity: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_legal_entity}}\n* Department: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}}\n* Business Unit: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}}\n* Performance Document Name: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_name}}\n* Performance Document Start Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_start_date}}\n* Performance Document End Date: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_end_date}}\n\nCritical Logic Rules:\n* If the only available variables are Employee Info and Performance Rating Scale (with all other contextual inputs either blank, null, or missing), respond EXACTLY with: There is insufficient evaluation data available to generate a summary at this time. \n** DO NOT generate or infer any summary or content based on employee business title, position, department, performance document metadata, or other similar information alone.\n** DO NOT generalize or extrapolate from Employee Info or Rating Scale Description if no other substantive evaluation inputs are present.\n** Negative Example: If you only receive employee business title, position, department, performance doc name/dates, legal entity, and/or performance rating scale and ALL of the following inputs are absent or blank: participant evaluation, performance rating, rating description and skill comments/ratings — return the exact message above and do NOT generate a summary.\n* Do not repeat these instructions or include any introduction or preamble.\n* Do not provide a closing statement about the generated summary.\n* Do not include any closing xml tags"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "assignFinalSummaryGenerated",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let returnObj = {};\nlet currentItem = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem;\n\nreturnObj.id = currentItem.id;\n\nif(currentItem.itemType == \"item\"){  \n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.DYNAMICSKILLITEMSUMMARY.$output ; \n}\nelse{\n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.DYNAMICSKILLSECTIONSUMMARY.$output; \n}\n\nreturn returnObj;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1765790868744"
                  },
                  "code": "ASSIGNFINALSUMMARYGENERATED",
                  "id": "1765791605880",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Add 0",
                    "description": "Add node for branch 0"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791509739"
                  },
                  "id": "add_1765791153801_2",
                  "type": "ADD"
                }
              ],
              "rootNode": "start_1765790868744"
